9. Regional Performance Deviation.
10. Pricing Deviation.
11. Promotion Performance Detection.
12. Supplier Performance Deviation.
13. Commercial Risk Detection.
14. Optimization Outcome Monitoring.
15. Decision Effectiveness Monitoring.

يجب أن ينتج:

- Alert.
- Severity.
- Evidence.
- Detected Metric.
- Expected Value.
- Actual Value.
- Variance.
- Threshold.
- Related Entity.
- Related Decision.
